  "body": "See\r\n\r\n- https://matrixlogs.bakkot.com/WHATWG/2022-06-29#L13-L14\r\n- https://matrixlogs.bakkot.com/WHATWG/2022-06-30#L0-L4\r\n\r\nWe can propose a 50-minute breakout session at [TPAC](https://www.w3.org/wiki/TPAC/2022) on Wednesday, possibly giving a group update for what has happened in HTML in the past year or so, and some time for discussion. The group update can also be [a pre-recorded video](https://www.w3.org/wiki/TPAC/2022/Demos_and_Group_updates).\r\n\r\nIs there interest for a breakout session? I can help prepare and present, but would welcome collaboration on that.\r\n\r\nWe can also try to get a 4-hour meeting scheduled. Is there interest for a meeting? If so, please suggest agenda items below.",
